            {
              "text": "A landslide and bench failure at Ashfell caused structural damage to the lower road and prompted warnings across Withel terraces and <PERSON>.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Evacuations were conducted from Withel terraces, <PERSON>, and Ashfell bench, alongside the displacement of approximately 60 households from Cranmoor.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "Service disruptions impacted Ashfell bench, Corvane mine pit, and the lower road, though the lower road was subsequently restored following policy revisions by the operator.",
